msgstr "Do you want to turn on yearly automatic renewal?"

#: templates/form-alta.php:341
msgid ""
"Te enviaremos el enlace de pago directo cuando tu cuota esté cerca de "
"caducar para que no tengas que preocuparte."
msgstr ""
"We will send you the direct payment link when your fee is close to expiring, "
"so you do not have to worry about it."

#: templates/form-alta.php:349
msgid "Pago por transferencia bancaria"
msgstr "Payment by bank transfer"

#: templates/form-alta.php:350
msgid ""
"Al confirmar tu alta te llevaremos a la pasarela de pago. Allí eliges el "
"método (tarjeta, Bizum o transferencia); si eliges transferencia, verás el "
"IBAN y el concepto que debes indicar."
msgstr ""
"When you confirm your sign-up we will take you to the payment gateway. There "
"you choose the method (card, Bizum or transfer); if you choose transfer, you "
"will see the IBAN and the reference to use."

#: templates/form-alta.php:351
msgid ""
"Podrás adjuntar el justificante directamente en esa página para que "
"validemos tu alta lo antes posible."
msgstr ""
"You will be able to attach the receipt on that page so that we can validate "
"your sign-up as soon as possible."

#: templates/form-alta.php:357
msgid "Pago seguro por pasarela bancaria"
msgstr "Secure payment by bank gateway"

